		<link>http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/expanding-quality-dev-practices-clean-coders-club/</link>
		<comments>http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/02/expanding-quality-dev-practices-clean-coders-club/#comments</comments>
