		<title>Programming is not a craft… but you can be a craftsman</title>
		<link>http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/01/programming-is-not-a-craft-but-you-can-be-a-craftsman/</link>
		<comments>http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2011/01/programming-is-not-a-craft-but-you-can-be-a-craftsman/#comments</comments>
